\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {4}{\ignorespaces Development-time comparison of three nested configurations (V1: Mondrian LAC; V2: plus gated weighting, the studied procedure; V3: plus quantile-regression thresholds). Panels show shift-case marginal gap, worst-slice gap, set-size ratio (lower is better) and per-seed scores over seeds 101--103 (higher is better; bar is the mean). V3 coincides with V2 in every retained value. Development cases and seeds differ from the sealed final data.}}{8}{figure.4}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:variants}{{4}{8}{Development-time comparison of three nested configurations (V1: Mondrian LAC; V2: plus gated weighting, the studied procedure; V3: plus quantile-regression thresholds). Panels show shift-case marginal gap, worst-slice gap, set-size ratio (lower is better) and per-seed scores over seeds 101--103 (higher is better; bar is the mean). V3 coincides with V2 in every retained value. Development cases and seeds differ from the sealed final data}{figure.4}{}}
